  "content": "<h1>暗影流光</h1><p><strong>模組說明</strong></p><p>將原版附魔光效改為深藍色星雲流光&nbsp;<em><br></em></p><p><em>此為僅限用戶端模組</em></p><p>由製作<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗RPG</a>的同一作者創作（想體驗完整RPG樂趣，可下載<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/darkrpg\" rel=\"nofollow\">黑暗RPG模組包</a>，享受任務與RPG玩法）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>特色功能</h2><h5>（這些功能將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）</h5><h5>將原版附魔物品與盔甲的標準光效，改為看起來超酷的深藍色星雲流光，在黑暗中效果特別出色！在無障礙設定中將流光強度調至100%可獲得最佳效果。</h5><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/989/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/977557893110964374/1135933208790323310/javaw_Tr5W8rud3d.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"801\" height=\"&quot;458\"></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/812/990/2024-02-23_00.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即取得伺服器與好友同樂！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>或下方橫幅，使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></p>",
